inding for `finalEvalProof` is tightened: `BindGkrFinalEvalProof` takes `wireLevels` from new `GkrProvingSchedule.WireLevels` and still omits only input wires proved in skip levels (assignment opening); input wires in sumcheck or single-source zero-check levels are bound again, fixing incorrect omission for multi-source inputs that are not skip-only.\nL184: Prover/verifier resources (template + all curve backends + gadget `Verify`) precompute `wireLevels` and pass them through. Tests add a realistic `MiMCCircuit` / `mimcLastGate` and pin expected schedules for depth 2 and 3.\nL185: \nL186: ^{Reviewed by 【80†Cursor Bugbot†cursor.com】 for commit 【81†`29c52c1`】. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure 【82†here†www.cursor.com】.}\nL187: \nL188: [Input][Input]\nL189: \nL190: Sorry, something went wrong.\nL191: ### Uh oh!\nL192: \nL193: There was an error while loading. Please reload this page.\nL194: \nL195: 【78†Tabaie】 added 2 commits 【83†September 17, 2026 11:02】\nL196: \nL197: ` 【84†fix: bind claimed evaluations when input wire is in sumcheck】 ` [Button: … ]\nL198: \nL199: [Input] [Input] [Input]\nL200: \nL201: ` 【84†1ee87bd】 `\nL202: \nL203:     Signed-off-by: Arya Tabaie <arya.pourtabatabaie@gmail.com>\nL204: \nL205: ` 【85†perf: merge compatible claim groups into the same sumcheck level】 ` [Button: … ]\nL206: \nL207: [Input] [Input] [Input]\nL208: ` 【85†e3c2b83】 `\nL209: \nL210:     Signed-off-by: Arya Tabaie <arya.pourtabatabaie@gmail.com>\nL211: \nL212: 【78†Tabaie】 requested review from 【86†eloi010】 and 【69†ivokub】 and a lite review from 【87†Copilot】 【88†September 21, 2026 16:26】\nL213: \nL214: Copilot 【89†started reviewing】 on behalf of 【78†Tabaie】 【90†September 21, 2026 16:27】\nL215: \nL216: 【89†View session】\nL217: \nL218: 【87†Copilot】 AI reviewed 【91†Sep 21, 2026】\nL219: \nL220: 【92†View reviewed changes】\nL221: ###\nL222: \nL223: 【87†Copilot】 AI left a comment\nL224: \nL225: Copy link\nL226: \nL227: Copy Markdown\nL228: \nL229: Ther